  "title": "Autumn Sweet Potato Shepherd&#39;s Pie",
  "description": "If you are looking for a variation on shepherd&#39;s pie, try this fall recipe with sweet potatoes, pumpkin, tomatoes, bell peppers, and ground turkey.",
